{
  "0": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_SEQ_00",
    "original": "Tamachag wants to investigate some unsavory dealings.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "24": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_TODO_00",
    "original": "Visit the stalls marked on your map.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "25": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_TODO_01",
    "original": "Report to Tamachag.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "48": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_TAMACHAG_000_001",
    "original": "Would you mind helping me with an investigation?",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "49": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_TAMACHAG_000_002",
    "original": "Those who do business here are allowed to set their own prices. However, I have heard word of a trader that has been abusing this system by charging more for their goods exclusively for foreign customers.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "51": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_TAMACHAG_000_004",
    "original": "Should this continue, Reunion\u0027s reputation shall suffer great damage. I have taken it upon myself to regularly check the traders\u0027 stalls, but I suspect the culprit is hiding their extortionate prices from me.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "52": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_TAMACHAG_000_005",
    "original": "That is why I require your help. Please investigate the local traders, taking note of their wares and the prices they sell them for.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "53": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_TAMACHAG_000_006",
    "original": "I have marked the five stalls I would like you to visit on your map. Report back to me when you are done.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "54": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_TAMACHAG_000_010",
    "original": "I have marked the five stalls I would like you to visit on your map. Report back to me when you are done.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "55": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_BAIDUR_000_020",
    "original": "Struggling to find something? Search no longer for I am sure to have it in stock!",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "56": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_SYSTEM_000_021",
    "original": "Baidur\u0027s stall contains a mix of meat, fish, and assorted trinkets. All of his wares are being sold for cheap prices.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "57": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_MASGUD_000_030",
    "original": "Come and get your hands on the juiciest fruit and vegetables available in Reunion!",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "58": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_SYSTEM_000_031",
    "original": "Masgud\u0027s stall contains fruit and vegetables. All of his wares are being sold for expensive prices.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "59": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_YESUI_000_040",
    "original": "You there, traveler! Can I interest you in some smoked meat? My prices may be steep, but satisfaction is guaranteed.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "60": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_SYSTEM_000_041",
    "original": "Yesui\u0027s stall contains raw meat, sausages, and smoked food. All of her wares are being sold for expensive prices.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "61": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_BOTOKHUI_000_050",
    "original": "Why, that exotic aura you emit... You must be a traveler from far-off lands! Can I interest you in some kumis? It is the most luxurious local drink I have on offer.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "62": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_SYSTEM_000_051",
    "original": "Botokhui\u0027s stall contains an assortment of alcoholic beverages. All of her wares are being sold for very expensive prices.",
    "translation": ""
  },
