  },
  "156": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_TAMACHAG_000_141",
    "original": "Kumis is hardly a luxury commodity in these parts. No doubt she was hoping a traveler such as yourself would be ignorant of the fact.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "157": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_TAMACHAG_000_142",
    "original": "She cannot be allowed to continue this kind of behavior. I will give her a stern warning later.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "158": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_TAMACHAG_000_143",
    "original": "Thank you for your help. The Qestir had entrusted me with a reward that I was to give to anyone able to aid me in uncovering the crafty trader. I would say you have done more than enough to be worthy of it!",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "159": {
    "tag": "TEXT_STMBDZ503_02754_TAMACHAG_000_150",
    "original": "Are you quite sure about that? You did not seem to be confident in your answers. By all means, go and check the stalls once more if your memory is hazy.",
    "translation": ""
  }
